{"about_the_game":"Welcome to Project: Morpheus, in this prologue packed with around 1-3 hours of content, you will reprise yourself as EAST, and play your way in this world where reality and dreams collide.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve the mysteries, escape the nightmare</h2></li></ul>EAST, a veteran who encountered an accident during a trip, woke up finding himself in a completely strange wilderness.<br>Unravel mysteries as you venture into this space, where secrets were hidden.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414430/extras/8fa55f678a651de3c65e8e8db5136dda.poster.avif?t=1650954198\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414430/extras/8fa55f678a651de3c65e8e8db5136dda.webm?t=1650954198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414430/extras/8fa55f678a651de3c65e8e8db5136dda.mp4?t=1650954198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore, search and manage your resources</h2></li></ul>Solve puzzles, collect resources, gather information and everything that can help you to survive.<br>The special physical inventory system will future challenge you to fit items with limited spaces, and manage encumbrance at the same time.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414430/extras/e9f31206900c2623c6e2db0459c0323e.poster.avif?t=1650954198\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414430/extras/e9f31206900c2623c6e2db0459c0323e.webm?t=1650954198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414430/extras/e9f31206900c2623c6e2db0459c0323e.mp4?t=1650954198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plan your strategy, progress through the crisis</h2></li></ul>The use of each prop and every bullet is very important. <br>Choose the right tools and strategy to face or escape from your enemies.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414430/extras/535a512cea9136b4fc90d612ebf7eb29.poster.avif?t=1650954198\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414430/extras/535a512cea9136b4fc90d612ebf7eb29.webm?t=1650954198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414430/extras/535a512cea9136b4fc90d612ebf7eb29.mp4?t=1650954198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A word from the team</strong></h2>We are a game development studio dedicated to creating action-adventure FPS/TPS games, for PC and consoles. <br>The team currently consists of 1 game designer and 1 lead programmer. And we are looking for inspirational individuals who share the same vision to join our team.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414430/extras/e9ca7c6831fa86907e30f5b031a1e8e6.poster.avif?t=1650954198\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414430/extras/e9ca7c6831fa86907e30f5b031a1e8e6.webm?t=1650954198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414430/extras/e9ca7c6831fa86907e30f5b031a1e8e6.mp4?t=1650954198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1414430?t=1650954198","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1414430?t=1650954198","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414430/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1650954198","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414430/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1650954198","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"Welcome to Project: Morpheus, in this prologue packed with around 1-3 hours of content, you will reprise yourself as EAST, and play your way in this world where reality and dreams collide.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve the mysteries, escape the nightmare</h2></li></ul>EAST, a veteran who encountered an accident during a trip, woke up finding himself in a completely strange wilderness.<br>Unravel mysteries as you venture into this space, where secrets were hidden.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414430/extras/8fa55f678a651de3c65e8e8db5136dda.poster.avif?t=1650954198\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414430/extras/8fa55f678a651de3c65e8e8db5136dda.webm?t=1650954198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414430/extras/8fa55f678a651de3c65e8e8db5136dda.mp4?t=1650954198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore, search and manage your resources</h2></li></ul>Solve puzzles, collect resources, gather information and everything that can help you to survive.<br>The special physical inventory system will future challenge you to fit items with limited spaces, and manage encumbrance at the same time.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414430/extras/e9f31206900c2623c6e2db0459c0323e.poster.avif?t=1650954198\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414430/extras/e9f31206900c2623c6e2db0459c0323e.webm?t=1650954198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414430/extras/e9f31206900c2623c6e2db0459c0323e.mp4?t=1650954198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plan your strategy, progress through the crisis</h2></li></ul>The use of each prop and every bullet is very important. <br>Choose the right tools and strategy to face or escape from your enemies.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414430/extras/535a512cea9136b4fc90d612ebf7eb29.poster.avif?t=1650954198\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414430/extras/535a512cea9136b4fc90d612ebf7eb29.webm?t=1650954198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414430/extras/535a512cea9136b4fc90d612ebf7eb29.mp4?t=1650954198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A word from the team</strong></h2>We are a game development studio dedicated to creating action-adventure FPS/TPS games, for PC and consoles. <br>The team currently consists of 1 game designer and 1 lead programmer. And we are looking for inspirational individuals who share the same vision to join our team.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414430/extras/e9ca7c6831fa86907e30f5b031a1e8e6.poster.avif?t=1650954198\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414430/extras/e9ca7c6831fa86907e30f5b031a1e8e6.webm?t=1650954198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414430/extras/e9ca7c6831fa86907e30f5b031a1e8e6.mp4?t=1650954198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","developers":["Team Ranger"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414430/header.jpg?t=1650954198","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1414430/327403/f364118a70ad9efb9b4821d1b56a9b6aa9c9417d/1751234856/dash_av1.mpd?t=1605842638","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1414430/327403/f364118a70ad9efb9b4821d1b56a9b6aa9c9417d/1751234856/dash_h264.mpd?t=1605842638","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1414430/327403/f364118a70ad9efb9b4821d1b56a9b6aa9c9417d/1751234856/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1605842638","id":256809956,"name":"Trailer 1.0","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256809956/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1605842638"}],"name":"Project Morpheus: Prologue","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit Windows 10<